      <p class="reading-list__note">Further guilty pleas, forfeitures and charges against U.S.-based facilitators.</p>
    </li>
    <li>
      {% set externalLink = { url: "https://home.treasury.gov/news/press-releases/jy1498", text: "Treasury Targets DPRK's International Agents and Illicit Cyber Intrusion Group" } %}{% include "partials/external-link.njk" %}
